        { "id": "prt_03a", "sessionID": "ses_07", "messageID": "msg_03", "type": "text", "text": "wait but isnt that literally the whole point of using typescript over js, i thought it checks the types when the server runs and throws if theyre wrong. why would anyone use it otherwise" }
